-- IVX — the second question set.
--
-- The first migration shipped 29 questions, about one and a half per skill, which is a demonstration and
-- not a practice session. This adds 186 more across all 18 skills, every one in English and Arabic,
-- with an explanation and a hint. Numeric questions are generated with their arithmetic checked by the
-- script that wrote this file, not typed by hand.
--
-- Safe to run twice: a question that already exists for a skill with the same prompt is skipped.

